 Site Energies SFO
 =================

 The Site energy of a SFO is defined here as the diagonal Fock matrix element
 of the Fock matrix in SFO representation, divided by the diagonal overlap matrix
 element of the overlap matrix in the SFO representation.
 In general, a SFO may be a linear combination of several Fragment Orbitals on the same,
